              "id": "code-4-5-binary-cross-entropy-bce-formulasi-klasifikasi-biner",
              "title": "Implementasi: 4.5. Binary Cross-Entropy (BCE): Formulasi Negatif Log-Likelihood Klasifikasi Probabilistik Biner",
