              "expectedOutput": " Step |     w_manual |    w_pytorch |  Selisih Absolut\n----------------------------------------------------\n    1 |     4.900000 |     4.900000 |         0.00e+00\n    2 |     4.800005 |     4.800005 |         0.00e+00\n    3 |     4.700021 |     4.700021 |         0.00e+00\n    4 |     4.600054 |     4.600054 |         0.00e+00\n    5 |     4.500114 |     4.500114 |         0.00e+00",
