              "expectedOutput": "Fold 1 Akurasi Validasi: 63.3%\nFold 2 Akurasi Validasi: 66.7%\nFold 3 Akurasi Validasi: 60.0%\n\nRata-rata Akurasi K-Fold : 63.3% (+/- 2.7%)\nAkurasi Total Out-Of-Fold: 63.3%",
