          "orderIndex": 5,
          "description": "Mekanisme pengkodean urutan spasial dan temporal: kelemahan invarian permutasi pada self-attention murni, perumusan Sinusoidal Positional Encoding, Learned Positional Embedding, serta Rotary Position Embedding (RoPE).",
