          "orderIndex": 3,
          "description": "Kompresi model melalui Kuantisasi (Quantization): perumusan affine mapping FP32 ke INT8, perbandingan Post-Training Quantization (PTQ) versus Quantization-Aware Training (QAT), dan dinamika kalibrasi skala-nol.",
